#NEXUS

[ Raven & Maidment 2018, PeerJ 6: e4529, Figure 8: strict consensus of Analysis D6, 60 tips at 2265x4500 px with 35-px glyphs. Four tips are printed as collapsed or informal names that the matrix list does not carry (Outgroup Taxa, Thescelosaurus, Tenontosaurus, Zalmoxes) and keep their printed text; the rest use the matrix spellings. Topology transcribed by the tool and checked node by node against the image (2026-10-27). CC BY 4.0; see attribution.txt. ]

